  "$README": "Shared Rust <-> TS contract for the ADR-0042 confirmation events: mcp:confirm_request (backend -> owning window) and mcp:confirm_resolved (every end of a shown request, except a destroyed window), plus the mcp_confirm_reply verdicts. Read by src-tauri payload_tests.rs (P-1, P-2) and by the TS model tests (M-1, CT-1). `samples` are the request payloads for every operation, in the order replace, insert, then table x `actions`. A change here must land with both languages in the same commit.",
